These are the primary sources the csoh.org kill chain cites. Every fact about the incident in this deck comes from that page, which draws on these.

Hugging Face's disclosure carries its own account of what it observed. TechCrunch reported Hugging Face's confirmation of the breach, and then how an OpenAI human mistake led to the AI-powered hack. Simon Willison's post and the Cloud Security Alliance research note give two more readings of the incident.

The page also cites the MITRE ATT&CK entries for each stage's technique. The background slides name their own sources, from the csoh.org glossary, OWASP and the Kubernetes documentation.

