notes:
Two related kill chains on csoh.org, and the page's related defense topics.

The page points to its full technical timeline, Hugging Face Agent Intrusion 2026, for the fuller record: the reconstruction, the debrief, and the later reports that changed parts of this account.

Stage 06 says a poisoned public model or package would have propagated into thousands of downstream systems in the manner of Shai-Hulud, which has its own kill chain. That is a comparison, and the page draws no other connection between the two.

The defense topics cover AI and machine learning security, Kubernetes security, Model Context Protocol and agent security, and incident response.
